Excretion.; Excretio.
Excretory.; Excretorium.

@AC 5380. It is known that there are secretions and excretions, in series, from the kidneys down to the bladder... They who in the Grand Man constitute these provinces...

@5386. Elsewhere in the body, too, there are Secretories and Excretories; in the brain.

