Exile.; Exilium.

@AC 379. When charity is sent into exile...

@TCR 23. Everything spiritual of reason is cast out into exile.

@AE 637[10]. To "go away into exile" (Jeremiah 49:3) = to be destroyed.

@811[6]. To "go away into exile" (Ezekiel 12:11) = the dissipation of truth.

Exile.; Exulis.
Exiled, To be.; Exulare. @TCR 404. @770.

