@DWis 5. 9. Love comes forth in use.

@DWis 11. 7a. Therefore, when the Lord's Divine love comes forth with man in charity... His Divine wisdom comes forth with man in faith...

@DWis 12. That the Lord... animates all things in Heaven and the world... some to live, and some to be and come forth.

