@8452[3]. When the external is put off... @8455[2].

@8870[3]. (Why external things must be taken away in the other life, although they enable them to act well.)

@9209[2]. By this the external is initiated into the internal of charity...

@9213. When an Angel or Spirit is in external things, he is in shade...

@9380. No conjunction with an external devoid of an internal. Signified.

@9391[11]. The worship of what is external. Signified, Explained.

@9409[5]. As in the Christian world at this day they are... in externals devoid of an internal...

@9424[5]. As takes place with those who are solely in externals and not at the same time in internals, that is, with those who are in the loves of self and of the world, and not in love to the Lord and towards the neighbour.

